{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":12893421,"ns":0,"title":"Lithocarpus kunstleri","revisions":[{"revid":1348311623,"parentid":1315112493,"minor":false,"timestamp":"2026-04-11T23:43:48Z","size":1854,"sha1":"7a05df9159f352c7488de943dc3df6baab8d7391","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Short description|Species of tree}}\n{{Speciesbox\n|image =\n|status = LR/cd\n|status_system = IUCN2.3\n|status_ref = <ref name= iucn>{{cite iucn |author=Chua, L.S.L. |date=1998 |title=''Lithocarpus kunstleri'' |volume=1998 |article-number=e.T31501A9637127 |doi=10.2305/IUCN.UK.1998.RLTS.T31501A9637127.en |access-date=11 April 2026}}</ref>\n|genus = Lithocarpus\n|species = kunstleri\n|authority = ([[George King (botanist)|King]] ex [[Hook.f.]]) [[A.Camus]]\n|synonyms = \n*''Pasania kunstleri'' {{small|(King ex Hook.f.) Schottky}}\n*''Quercus kunstleri'' {{small|King ex Hook.f.}}\n*''Synaedrys kunstleri'' {{small|(King ex Hook.f.) Koidz.}}\n|synonyms_ref = <ref name = powo>{{cite web |title=''Lithocarpus kunstleri'' (King ex Hook.f.) A.Camus |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:358826-1 |website=[[Plants of the World Online]] |publisher=[[Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew]] |access-date=11 April 2026}}</ref>\n}}\n\n'''''Lithocarpus kunstleri''''' is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Fagaceae]]. It is a tree [[endemism|endemic]] to [[Peninsular Malaysia]].<ref name = powo/> It is native to primary and secondary [[Peninsular Malaysian rain forests|lowland rain forest]] and swamps up to 300 meters elevation. It is threatened by [[habitat loss]].<ref name = iucn/>\n\nThe species was first described as ''Quercus kunstleri'' by [[Joseph Dalton Hooker]] in 1888. In 1931 [[Aimée Antoinette Camus]] placed the species in genus ''[[Lithocarpus]]'' as ''L. kunstleri''.<ref name = powo/>\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Taxonbar|from=Q5438167}}\n\n[[Category:Lithocarpus|kunstleri]]\n[[Category:Endemi